CAFA-evaluator-PK
=================

This repository is a fork in the CAFA-evaluator line and carries code written
by several authors. The chain is:

    CAFA-evaluator-PK (this fork)
        |
        +-- forked from CAFA-evaluator-PK (Clara De Paolis)
        |       +-- derived from CAFA-evaluator (BioComputing UP, Padua)
        |
        +-- sparse evaluation ported from cafaeval-protea
                (Francisco Miguel Pérez Canales)
                    +-- which carries the speedups of
                        CAFA-evaluator-PK-speedup (Antonina Dolgorukova)

All components are distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3
or later. The full license text is in LICENCE.md. Modifications are listed
with their dates in CHANGELOG.md, per GPLv3 section 5(a).


